//RS /// its `BuildContext` parameter and `BuildPlan` result have no runtime
//RS /// lowering — and raised an internal compiler error on a program sema had just
//RS /// accepted. Sema and codegen disagreed about coverage; the fix is on the
//RS /// admitting side, and it removes the item rather than teaching codegen to
